  m_text: 'This game offers a thrilling and scary experience.By downloading and playing
    this game, you acknowledge and accept the risks associated with the game''s frightening
    content.

    Before playing, please always consider your health. If you have
    any concerns, especially if you suffer from heart problems or other medical conditions,
    please consult a doctor beforehand.

    If you have epilepsy or any type of
    seizure disorder, please consult your doctor before using this game.



    If
    you develop any of the following health problems or symptoms, stop using immediately
    and do not resume play until you have consulted a doctor:



    Dizziness -
    Changes in vision - Eye or muscle twitching - Loss of consciousness - Disorientation
    - Seizures - Any involuntary movement or jerking



    Resumption of play requires
    medical approval.



    To reduce the risk of seizures, we recommend the following
    usage and precautions:

    Avoid prolonged use of the game. Take 15-minute breaks
    every hour of play.

    Avoid playing when you are feeling unwell or are sleep-deprived.

    Please
    understand that this information is not medical advice and should not replace
    the diagnosis of a doctor.



    If you are a minor or under the legal age of
    majority in your country, please have your legal guardian review these health
    and safety precautions before using this game.



    We hereby disclaim all
    liability for any direct, indirect, incidental, special, exemplary, or consequential
    damages resulting from or in connection with your participation in this game,
    to the maximum extent allowed by applicable law.



    If you understand and
    agree to the above, please click the "Confirm" button.

'
